<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank sets warrants on HK property basket.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets warrants on HK property basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG,</p>
<p>London Branch, said on Tuesday it plans to issue 480 million</p>
<p>American-style call warrants on a basket of six property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Great Eagle Holdings Ltd	 0.04 shares</p>
<p> Hysan Development Co Ltd	 0.06 shares</p>
<p> Hang Lung Development Co Ltd   0.10 shares</p>
<p> Amoy Properties Ltd		0.17 shares</p>
<p> Swire Pacific Ltd &quot;A&quot;	    0.02 shares</p>
<p> Wharf (Holdings) Ltd	     0.06 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$7.96	  PREMIUM	 9.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.144	 GEARING	 6.0x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   20.MAR.98	PAYDATE	 02.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  04.JUN.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$8.606	 EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW	HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		   CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT</p>
<p>ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
